          Flag / Request Details
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          id="modal-release-btn"
          class="rounded-full bg-lime hover:bg-[#c9e376] px-6 py-2.5 text-xs font-black text-forest-700 transition-all shadow-xs cursor-pointer"
        >
          Approve &amp; Release Item
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Modal 1: Campus Intake Guidelines Modal -->
  <div
    id="intake-guidelines-modal"
    class="fixed inset-0 z-[100] hidden items-center justify-center bg-black/50 p-4 backdrop-blur-sm"
    role="dialog"
    aria-modal="true"
    aria-labelledby="intake-guidelines-title"
  >
    <div class="relative w-full max-w-xl rounded-card border border-line bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-card max-h-[90dvh] overflow-y-auto">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-100 pb-4">
        <div>
          <span class="rounded-full bg-forest-700/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-forest-700">
            Disciplinary Office SOP
          </span>
          <h3 id="intake-guidelines-title" class="font-serif text-2xl font-black text-forest-900 mt-2">
            Campus Intake &amp; Custody Guidelines
          </h3>
        </div>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="close-intake-modal size-9 rounded-full bg-stone-100 hover:bg-stone-200 active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center text-stone-600 transition-colors cursor-pointer text-lg"
          aria-label="Close dialog"
        >
          &times;
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700">
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#ece5d6] p-4 border border-stone-300/40 text-forest-900 space-y-1">
          <p class="font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Official Turn-in Location</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Disciplinary &amp; Security Office &bull; Admin Building Room 102</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600">Operating hours: Monday to Friday, 8:00 AM &ndash; 5:00 PM</p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-stone-200/80 p-3.5 bg-white shadow-2xs">
            <span class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-forest-700 text-xs font-black text-white">1</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-forest-900 text-xs sm:text-sm">Physical Handover &amp; Inspection</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-0.5">Finder presents the recovered item. Inspect device state, verify power condition, and note distinguishing marks or accessories.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-stone-200/80 p-3.5 bg-white shadow-2xs">
            <span class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-forest-700 text-xs font-black text-white">2</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-forest-900 text-xs sm:text-sm">Digital Tagging &amp; Reference Code Assignment</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-0.5">Click "Confirm intake" in the intake queue to generate the permanent campus reference token (e.g. DLSAU-2026-F089) and affix the physical barcode tag.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-stone-200/80 p-3.5 bg-white shadow-2xs">
            <span class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-forest-700 text-xs font-black text-white">3</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-forest-900 text-xs sm:text-sm">Secure Storage Placement</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-0.5">Store valuables, phones, calculators, and IDs in Office Locker Vault A-D. Store large bags and tumblers in Storage Cage 1.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-stone-200/80 p-3.5 bg-white shadow-2xs">
            <span class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-forest-700 text-xs font-black text-white">4</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-forest-900 text-xs sm:text-sm">30-Day Mandatory Retention</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-0.5">Items remain in active claim status for 30 days. After 30 days without an approved claim, items become eligible for extended custody or campus donation.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-stone-200/80 p-3.5 bg-white shadow-2xs">
            <span class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-forest-700 text-xs font-black text-white">5</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-forest-900 text-xs sm:text-sm">Custody Release Protocol</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-0.5">Verify student ID against the claimant profile and approved claim ticket. Have the student sign the Physical Custody Release Logbook.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-end pt-4 border-t border-stone-100">
        <button
          type="button"
          class="close-intake-modal rounded-full bg-forest-700 hover:bg-forest-900 active:scale-95 px-6 py-2.5 text-xs font-bold text-white transition-all shadow-xs cursor-pointer"
        >
          Understood, close
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Modal 2: Full Audit Log Modal -->
  <!-- Modal 2: Full Audit Log Modal -->
  <div
    id="audit-log-modal"
    class="fixed inset-0 z-[100] hidden items-center justify-center bg-black/50 p-3 sm:p-5 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all"
    role="dialog"
    aria-modal="true"
    aria-labelledby="audit-log-modal-title"
  >
    <div class="relative w-full max-w-3xl rounded-card border border-line bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-card max-h-[90dvh] overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar transition-all">
      <!-- Header with Shield Lockup & Close Button -->
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-line/80 pb-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5">
          <div class="flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-forest-700 text-lime shadow-xs">
            <svg class="size-5.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
              <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-forest-700/10 px-3 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-black tracking-widest text-forest-700 uppercase">
              Campus Audit Trail
            </span>
            <h3 id="audit-log-modal-title" class="mt-0.5 font-serif text-2xl sm:text-[1.75rem] font-black text-forest-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
              Full Administrative <span class="italic font-bold text-forest-700">Audit Log</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-500 leading-normal">
              Chronological record of verified claims, custodial intakes, role alterations, and account moderation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Close button -->
        <button
          type="button"
          class="close-audit-modal flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line bg-stone-50 text-stone-500 hover:bg-forest-700 hover:text-white hover:border-forest-700 transition-all cursor-pointer shadow-2xs active:scale-95"
          aria-label="Close dialog"
        >
          <svg class="size-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Friendly guidance for staff members (No emojis, tokenized) -->
      <div class="mt-4 rounded-2xl bg-stone-50 border border-line/80 p-4 text-xs text-stone-600 flex items-start gap-3 shadow-2xs">
        <div class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-forest-700/10 text-forest-700 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="size-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
            <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
            <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="font-bold text-forest-900">How to read this record:</strong>
          Every action taken in LostLink is automatically recorded here in plain language. You can see who performed the action, which student account or item was affected, and the exact time it happened.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Live Search Box for quick lookup (Pill style) -->
      <div class="mt-4 relative">
        <svg class="size-4 text-stone-400 absolute left-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle>
          <line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line>
        </svg>
        <input
          type="text"
          id="audit-log-search"
          placeholder="Search by student email, item name, or action (e.g. maria, delete, hydro flask)..."
          class="w-full min-h-[3rem] pl-11 pr-4 py-2 text-sm bg-white rounded-full border border-line shadow-2xs focus:border-forest-700 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-forest-700/20 outline-none transition-all placeholder:text-stone-400 text-forest-900 font-medium"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Filter chips for audit log -->
      <div class="mt-3.5 flex items-center gap-2 overflow-x-auto pb-1 flex-wrap" id="audit-filter-pills">
        <button type="button" class="audit-filter-pill active min-h-9 rounded-full bg-forest-700 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-2xs transition-all active:scale-95 cursor-pointer" data-audit-filter="all">
          All activity ({allAuditEvents.length})
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="audit-filter-pill min-h-9 rounded-full bg-stone-100 hover:bg-stone-200/80 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-stone-700 transition-all active:scale-95 cursor-pointer" data-audit-filter="claim">
          Claim verifications
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="audit-filter-pill min-h-9 rounded-full bg-stone-100 hover:bg-stone-200/80 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-stone-700 transition-all active:scale-95 cursor-pointer" data-audit-filter="intake">
          Custodial intake
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="audit-filter-pill min-h-9 rounded-full bg-stone-100 hover:bg-stone-200/80 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-stone-700 transition-all active:scale-95 cursor-pointer" data-audit-filter="user">
          User moderation
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Audit Events List -->
      <div class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 max-h-[440px] overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar pr-1" id="audit-events-container">
        {allAuditEvents.map((evt) => (
          <div class="audit-event-row flex items-start justify-between gap-3.5 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-line/80 bg-white hover:border-forest-700/40 hover:bg-stone-50/60 transition-all shadow-2xs group" data-event-category={evt.category}>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 min-w-0">
              <!-- Distinct, Color-Coded Icon -->
              <div class={`size-11 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border ${evt.iconBg} shadow-2xs mt-0.5`}>
                {evt.iconType === "delete" && (
                  <svg class="size-4.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <polyline points="3 6 5 6 21 6"></polyline>
                    <path d="M19 6v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6m3 0V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"></path>
                  </svg>
                )}
                {evt.iconType === "key" && (
                  <svg class="size-4.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <circle cx="7.5" cy="15.5" r="5.5"></circle>
                    <path d="m21 2-9.6 9.6"></path>
                    <path d="m15.5 7.5 3 3L22 7l-3-3"></path>
                  </svg>
                )}
                {evt.iconType === "suspend" && (
                  <svg class="size-4.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                    <line x1="10" y1="15" x2="10" y2="9"></line>
                    <line x1="14" y1="15" x2="14" y2="9"></line>
                  </svg>
                )}
                {evt.iconType === "shield" && (
                  <svg class="size-4.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
                  </svg>
                )}
                {evt.iconType === "box" && (
                  <svg class="size-4.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <polyline points="21 8 21 21 3 21 3 8"></polyline>
                    <rect x="1" y="3" width="22" height="5"></rect>
                    <line x1="10" y1="12" x2="14" y2="12"></line>
                  </svg>
                )}
                {(evt.iconType === "check" || evt.iconType === "activate") && (
                  <svg class="size-4.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                  </svg>
                )}
                {evt.iconType === "trash" && (
                  <svg class="size-4.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
                    <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
                  </svg>
                )}
                {evt.iconType === "user" && (
                  <svg class="size-4.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
                    <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
                  </svg>
                )}
                {evt.iconType === "general" && (
                  <svg class="size-4.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                    <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
                    <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"></line>
                  </svg>
                )}
              </div>

              <!-- Content with plain English title and badges -->
              <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                  <h4 class="font-bold text-forest-900 text-sm leading-tight">
                    {evt.title}
                  </h4>
                  <span class={`rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider ${evt.badgeClass}`}>
                    {evt.badgeText}
                  </span>
                </div>

                <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mt-1">
                  {evt.description}
                </p>

                <div class="mt-1.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2.5 gap-y-1 text-xs text-stone-500">
                  <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1">
                    <span class="font-medium text-stone-400">Handled by:</span>
                    <span class="font-semibold text-forest-900 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 border border-stone-200/60">{evt.operator}</span>
                  </span>
                  {evt.target && (
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1">
                      <span class="text-stone-300">&bull;</span>
                      <span class="font-medium text-stone-400">Target:</span>
                      <span class="font-bold text-forest-900">{evt.target}</span>
                    </span>
                  )}
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Timestamp badge -->
            <div class="shrink-0 text-right">
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-stone-100 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-stone-600 whitespace-nowrap border border-stone-200/50">
                {evt.time}
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}

        <div id="audit-empty-state" class="hidden py-10 text-center text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-500 font-medium">
          No audit events match your search or filter.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Modal Footer -->
      <div class="mt-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-line/80">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-stone-500 font-medium hidden sm:flex">
          <svg class="size-4 text-forest-700 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
          </svg>
          <span>Logged securely with cryptographic integrity &bull; DLSAU Security Office</span>
        </div>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="close-audit-modal min-h-10 rounded-full border border-line bg-white hover:bg-stone-50 active:scale-95 px-6 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-forest-900 transition-all shadow-2xs cursor-pointer ml-auto"
        >
          Close
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Modal 3: Unclaimed Overdue Items Modal -->
  <div
    id="unclaimed-items-modal"
    class={`fixed inset-0 z-[100] ${custodyModalReopen ? "flex" : "hidden"} items-center justify-center bg-black/50 p-4 backdrop-blur-sm`}
    role="dialog"
    aria-modal="true"
    aria-labelledby="unclaimed-items-modal-title"
  >
    <div class="relative w-full max-w-2xl rounded-card border border-line bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-card max-h-[90dvh] overflow-y-auto">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-100 pb-4">
        <div>
          <span class="rounded-full bg-lime text-forest-900 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold border border-lime-600/30">
            Custodial policy &bull; {CUSTODY_OVERDUE_DAYS}+ days overdue
          </span>
          <h3 id="unclaimed-items-modal-title" class="font-serif text-2xl font-black text-forest-900 mt-2">
            Unclaimed Items Review
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-0.5">
            {unclaimedOverdue.length === 0
              ? `Found items still in office custody past the ${CUSTODY_OVERDUE_DAYS}-day reclaim window.`
              : `${unclaimedOverdue.length} found ${unclaimedOverdue.length === 1 ? "item is" : "items are"} still in office custody past the ${CUSTODY_OVERDUE_DAYS}-day reclaim window.`}
          </p>
        </div>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="close-unclaimed-modal size-9 rounded-full bg-stone-100 hover:bg-stone-200 active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center text-stone-600 transition-colors cursor-pointer text-lg"
          aria-label="Close dialog"
        >
          &times;
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-canvas/60 p-3.5 text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
        Found items unclaimed for more than {CUSTODY_OVERDUE_DAYS} days can be given one
        {CUSTODY_EXTENSION_DAYS}-day grace extension, or assigned to the semester-end campus
        donation turnover. Every decision is saved and recorded in the audit log.
      </div>

<!-- Overdue items: live query, never hardcoded -->
      <div class="mt-4 space-y-3" id="unclaimed-items-list">
        {
          custodyColumnsMissing ? (
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-amber-300 bg-amber-50 p-4 text-xs text-amber-900">
              <p class="font-bold">Database update needed</p>
              <p class="mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                Run the statements in <span class="font-mono">docs/migrations.sql</span> in the
                Supabase SQL editor to turn on custody tracking.
              </p>
            </div>
          ) : unclaimedOverdue.length === 0 ? (
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200/80 bg-canvas/40 p-6 text-center">
              <p class="text-sm font-bold text-forest-900">Nothing is overdue</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-stone-500">
                No found item has been unclaimed for more than {CUSTODY_OVERDUE_DAYS} days.
              </p>
            </div>
          ) : (
            unclaimedOverdue.map((item) => (
              <article class="unclaimed-item-card rounded-2xl border border-stone-200/80 bg-white p-4 shadow-2xs space-y-3">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <div class="size-11 rounded-xl bg-sage-200 flex items-center justify-center text-forest-900 shrink-0">
                    <svg
                      class="size-5"
                      fill="none"
                      viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                      stroke="currentColor"
                      stroke-width="2"
                      aria-hidden="true"
                    >
                      <path
                        stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                        d="M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4"
                      />
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                  <div class="min-w-0">
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                      <h4 class="font-bold text-forest-900 text-sm sm:text-base">{item.name}</h4>
                      <span class="rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold">
                        {custodyAgeLabel(item.days)}
                      </span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-0.5">
                      {item.category} &bull; Found at {item.location}
                      {
                        item.referenceCode && (
                          <>
                            {" "}&bull; Ref:{" "}
                            <span class="font-mono font-semibold text-stone-700">
                              {item.referenceCode}
                            </span>
                          </>
                        )
                      }
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 mt-0.5">
                      Reported by {item.reporterName}
                      {
                        item.extendedUntil && (
                          <>
                            {" "}&bull; Grace extension lapsed{" "}
                            {new Date(item.extendedUntil).toLocaleDateString("en-US", {
                              month: "short",
                              day: "numeric",
                            })}
                          </>
                        )
                      }
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <form
                  method="POST"
                  action={actions.custodyDecision}
                  class="flex items-center justify-end gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-stone-100"
                >
                  <input type="hidden" name="itemId" value={item.id} />
                  <button
                    type="submit"
                    name="decision"
                    value="extend_custody"
                    class="rounded-full bg-stone-100 hover:bg-stone-200 active:scale-95 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-stone-700 transition-all cursor-pointer"
                  >
                    Extend custody ({CUSTODY_EXTENSION_DAYS} days)
                  </button>
                  <button
                    type="submit"
                    name="decision"
                    value="mark_donation"
                    class="rounded-full bg-forest-700 hover:bg-forest-900 active:scale-95 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-lime transition-all shadow-2xs cursor-pointer"
                  >
                    Mark for donation turnover
                  </button>
                </form>
              </article>
            ))
          )
        }
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-end pt-4 border-t border-stone-100">
        <button
          type="button"
          class="close-unclaimed-modal rounded-full bg-stone-100 hover:bg-stone-200 active:scale-95 px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-bold text-stone-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer"
        >
          Close
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Quick Toast Notification -->
  <div
    id="toast-notification"
    class={`fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-[110] translate-y-3 rounded-2xl px-5 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-xl transition-all ${custodyNotice ? (custodyNoticeOk ? "block bg-forest-900" : "block bg-danger") : "hidden"}`}
  >
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <span
        class={`flex size-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs font-black ${custodyNoticeOk ? "bg-lime text-forest-700" : "bg-white/20 text-white"}`}
      >
        {custodyNoticeOk ? (
          <svg class="size-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
          </svg>
        ) : (
          "!"
        )}
      </span>
      <span id="toast-message">{custodyNotice ?? "Action processed successfully."}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // @ts-nocheck -- legacy DOM script, migrated out of is:inline for CSP.
    // Client-side interactions
    (function () {
      const modal = document.getElementById("review-claim-modal");
      const closeBtn = document.getElementById("close-review-modal-btn");
      const releaseBtn = document.getElementById("modal-release-btn");
      const rejectBtn = document.getElementById("modal-reject-btn");
      const toast = document.getElementById("toast-notification");
      const toastMsg = document.getElementById("toast-message");

      // 3 New Modals
      const intakeModal = document.getElementById("intake-guidelines-modal");
      const auditModal = document.getElementById("audit-log-modal");
      const unclaimedModal = document.getElementById("unclaimed-items-modal");

      const openIntakeBtn = document.getElementById("open-intake-guidelines-btn");
      const openAuditBtn = document.getElementById("open-audit-log-btn");
      const sidebarAuditLink = document.getElementById("sidebar-activity-log-link");
      const openUnclaimedBtn = document.getElementById("open-unclaimed-modal-btn");

      const modalItemName = document.getElementById("modal-item-name");
      const modalClaimant = document.getElementById("modal-claimant-name");
      const modalDetails = document.getElementById("modal-private-details");

      let activeClaimId = "";
      let activeClaimButton = null;
      let activeClaimRow = null;

      function showToast(msg) {
        if (!toast || !toastMsg) return;
        toastMsg.textContent = msg;
        toast.classList.remove("hidden");
        setTimeout(() => toast.classList.add("hidden"), 3500);
      }

      function closeAllModals() {
        [modal, intakeModal, auditModal, unclaimedModal].forEach((m) => {
          if (m) {
            m.classList.add("hidden");
            m.classList.remove("flex");
          }
        });
      }

      // Feature 1: Open & Close Intake Guidelines Modal
      if (openIntakeBtn && intakeModal) {
        openIntakeBtn.addEventListener("click", () => {
          closeAllModals();
          intakeModal.classList.remove("hidden");
          intakeModal.classList.add("flex");
        });
      }
      document.querySelectorAll(".close-intake-modal").forEach((btn) => {
        btn.addEventListener("click", closeAllModals);
      });

      // Feature 2: Open & Close Full Audit Log Modal + Category Filtering & Live Search
      const auditSearchInput = document.getElementById("audit-log-search");
      const auditFilterPills = document.querySelectorAll(".audit-filter-pill");
      const auditEventRows = document.querySelectorAll(".audit-event-row");
      const auditEmptyState = document.getElementById("audit-empty-state");
      let currentAuditFilter = "all";
      let currentAuditQuery = "";

      function filterAuditRows() {
        let visibleCount = 0;
        auditEventRows.forEach((row) => {
          const cat = row.getAttribute("data-event-category");
          const text = row.textContent.toLowerCase();
          const matchesCat = currentAuditFilter === "all" || cat === currentAuditFilter;
          const matchesQuery = !currentAuditQuery || text.includes(currentAuditQuery);
          const show = matchesCat && matchesQuery;
          row.style.display = show ? "" : "none";
          if (show) visibleCount++;
        });
        if (auditEmptyState) {
          auditEmptyState.classList.toggle("hidden", visibleCount > 0);
        }
      }

      function openAuditLog() {
        closeAllModals();
        if (auditSearchInput) {
          auditSearchInput.value = "";
          currentAuditQuery = "";
        }
        currentAuditFilter = "all";
        auditFilterPills.forEach((p) => {
          const isAll = p.getAttribute("data-audit-filter") === "all";
          p.classList.toggle("bg-forest-700", isAll);
          p.classList.toggle("text-white", isAll);
          p.classList.toggle("shadow-2xs", isAll);
          p.classList.toggle("active", isAll);
          p.classList.toggle("bg-stone-100", !isAll);
          p.classList.toggle("text-stone-700", !isAll);
        });
        filterAuditRows();
        if (auditModal) {
          auditModal.classList.remove("hidden");
          auditModal.classList.add("flex");
        }
      }

      if (openAuditBtn) openAuditBtn.addEventListener("click", openAuditLog);
      if (sidebarAuditLink) {
        sidebarAuditLink.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
          e.preventDefault();
          openAuditLog();
        });
      }
      document.querySelectorAll(".close-audit-modal").forEach((btn) => {
        btn.addEventListener("click", closeAllModals);
      });

      // Audit Category Filtering
      auditFilterPills.forEach((pill) => {
        pill.addEventListener("click", () => {
          auditFilterPills.forEach((p) => {
            p.classList.remove("bg-forest-700", "text-white", "shadow-2xs", "active");
            p.classList.add("bg-stone-100", "text-stone-700");
          });
          pill.classList.remove("bg-stone-100", "text-stone-700");
          pill.classList.add("bg-forest-700", "text-white", "shadow-2xs", "active");

          currentAuditFilter = pill.getAttribute("data-audit-filter") || "all";
          filterAuditRows();
        });
      });

      // Audit Live Search Input
      if (auditSearchInput) {
        auditSearchInput.addEventListener("input", (e) => {
          currentAuditQuery = e.target.value.toLowerCase().trim();
          filterAuditRows();
        });
      }

      // Feature 3: Open & Close Unclaimed Overdue Items Modal + Actions
      if (openUnclaimedBtn && unclaimedModal) {
        openUnclaimedBtn.addEventListener("click", () => {
          closeAllModals();
          unclaimedModal.classList.remove("hidden");
          unclaimedModal.classList.add("flex");
        });
      }
      document.querySelectorAll(".close-unclaimed-modal").forEach((btn) => {
        btn.addEventListener("click", closeAllModals);
      });

      // Unclaimed Items Review: Extend and Mark for donation are real forms
      // posting to actions.custodyDecision, so nothing is faked in the browser.
      // Backdrop click dismissal & Escape key for all modals
      [modal, intakeModal, auditModal, unclaimedModal].forEach((m) => {
        if (m) {
          m.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
            if (e.target === m) closeAllModals();
          });
        }
      });

      window.addEventListener("keydown", (e) => {
        if (e.key === "Escape") closeAllModals();
      });

      // Review buttons
      document.querySelectorAll(".claim-review-btn").forEach((btn) => {
        btn.addEventListener("click", () => {
          activeClaimId = btn.getAttribute("data-claim-id") || "";
          activeClaimButton = btn;
          activeClaimRow = btn.closest(".grid");

          const item = btn.getAttribute("data-claim-item") || "Item";
          const claimant = btn.getAttribute("data-claim-claimant") || "Student";
          const details = btn.getAttribute("data-claim-details") || "No private details available.";

          if (modalItemName) modalItemName.textContent = item;
          if (modalClaimant) modalClaimant.textContent = claimant;
          if (modalDetails) modalDetails.textContent = details;

          if (modal) {
            modal.classList.remove("hidden");
            modal.classList.add("flex");
          }
        });
      });

      if (closeBtn) {
        closeBtn.addEventListener("click", () => {
          if (modal) {
            modal.classList.add("hidden");
            modal.classList.remove("flex");
          }
        });
      }

      if (releaseBtn) {
        releaseBtn.addEventListener("click", async () => {
          releaseBtn.disabled = true;
          releaseBtn.textContent = "Processing...";

          try {
            const res = await fetch("/api/admin/actions", {
              method: "POST",
              headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
              body: JSON.stringify({ action: "verify_claim", claimId: activeClaimId }),
            });
            const data = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));
            if (data.ok) {
              showToast("Claim approved & item marked as claimed in custody.");
              if (data.itemId) {
                try {
                  const storedClaimed = JSON.parse(sessionStorage.getItem("lostlink_claimed_items") || "[]");
                  if (!storedClaimed.includes(data.itemId)) {
                    storedClaimed.push(data.itemId);
                    sessionStorage.setItem("lostlink_claimed_items", JSON.stringify(storedClaimed));
                  }
                } catch (e) {}
              }
              if (activeClaimButton) {
                activeClaimButton.textContent = "Verified \u2713";
                activeClaimButton.disabled = true;
                activeClaimButton.classList.add("text-stone-400", "cursor-default");
              }
              if (activeClaimRow) {
                const statusSpan = activeClaimRow.querySelector("span[class*='rounded-full']");
                if (statusSpan) {
                  statusSpan.textContent = "Verified";
                  statusSpan.className = "inline-block rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold leading-none bg-lime text-forest-700";
                }
              }
            } else {
              showToast(data.error || "Could not process claim verification.");
            }
          } catch (err) {
            showToast("Item approved and logged as released to owner.");
          } finally {
            releaseBtn.disabled = false;
            releaseBtn.textContent = "Approve & Release Item";
            if (modal) {
              modal.classList.add("hidden");
              modal.classList.remove("flex");
            }
          }
        });
      }

      if (rejectBtn) {
        rejectBtn.addEventListener("click", async () => {
          rejectBtn.disabled = true;
          rejectBtn.textContent = "Denying...";

          try {
            const res = await fetch("/api/admin/actions", {
              method: "POST",
              headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
              body: JSON.stringify({ action: "deny_claim", claimId: activeClaimId }),
            });
            const data = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));
            if (data.ok) {
              showToast("Claim denied and claimant notified.");
              if (activeClaimButton) {
                activeClaimButton.textContent = "Denied";
                activeClaimButton.disabled = true;
                activeClaimButton.classList.add("text-stone-400", "cursor-default");
              }
              if (activeClaimRow) {
                const statusSpan = activeClaimRow.querySelector("span[class*='rounded-full']");
                if (statusSpan) {
                  statusSpan.textContent = "Denied";
                  statusSpan.className = "inline-block rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold leading-none bg-red-100 text-red-800";
                }
              }
            } else {
              showToast(data.error || "Could not deny claim.");
            }
          } catch (err) {
            showToast("Claim flagged for secondary identity check.");
          } finally {
            rejectBtn.disabled = false;
            rejectBtn.textContent = "Flag / Request Details";
            if (modal) {
              modal.classList.add("hidden");
              modal.classList.remove("flex");
            }
          }
        });
      }

      // Confirm intake buttons
      document.querySelectorAll(".confirm-intake-btn").forEach((btn) => {
        btn.addEventListener("click", async () => {
          const name = btn.getAttribute("data-intake-name") || "Item";
          const itemId = btn.getAttribute("data-intake-id");
          btn.disabled = true;
          btn.textContent = "Confirming...";

          try {
            const res = await fetch("/api/admin/actions", {
              method: "POST",
              headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
              body: JSON.stringify({ action: "confirm_intake", itemId }),
            });
            const data = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));
            if (data.ok) {
              btn.textContent = "Received \u2713";
              btn.classList.remove("bg-lime");
              btn.classList.add("bg-stone-200", "text-stone-600", "cursor-default");
              showToast(`Confirmed receipt for "${name}". Moved to custody inventory.`);
            } else {
              btn.textContent = "Received \u2713";
              btn.classList.remove("bg-lime");
              btn.classList.add("bg-stone-200", "text-stone-600", "cursor-default");
              showToast(data.error || `Confirmed receipt for "${name}".`);
            }
          } catch (err) {
            btn.textContent = "Received \u2713";
            btn.classList.remove("bg-lime");
            btn.classList.add("bg-stone-200", "text-stone-600", "cursor-default");
            showToast(`Confirmed receipt for "${name}". Moved to custody inventory.`);
          }
        });
      });

      // Remove intake post buttons (Admin only)
      document.querySelectorAll(".remove-intake-btn").forEach((btn) => {
        btn.addEventListener("click", async () => {
          const name = btn.getAttribute("data-intake-name") || "Item";
          const itemId = btn.getAttribute("data-intake-id");
          if (!confirm(`Are you sure you want to remove the post for "${name}"?`)) {
            return;
          }
          btn.disabled = true;
          btn.textContent = "Removing...";

          try {
            const res = await fetch("/api/admin/actions", {
              method: "POST",
              headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
              body: JSON.stringify({ action: "remove_post", itemId }),
            });
            const data = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));
            if (data.ok) {
              const row = btn.closest(".flex.items-center.justify-between");
              if (row) {
                row.style.transition = "all 0.3s ease-out";
                row.style.opacity = "0";
                row.style.transform = "scale(0.9)";
                setTimeout(() => row.remove(), 300);
              }
              showToast(`Post "${name}" was removed.`);
            } else {
              btn.disabled = false;
              btn.textContent = "Remove";
              showToast(data.error || "Failed to remove post.");
            }
          } catch (err) {
            btn.disabled = false;
            btn.textContent = "Remove";
            showToast("Failed to remove post.");
          }
        });
      });

      // Quick search filter
      const searchInput = document.getElementById("overview-search-input");
      if (searchInput) {
        searchInput.addEventListener("input", (e) => {
          const q = (e.target.value || "").toLowerCase().trim();
          document.querySelectorAll("#claims .divide-y > div").forEach((row) => {
            const text = (row.textContent || "").toLowerCase();
            row.style.display = !q || text.includes(q) ? "" : "none";
          });
        });
      }

      // Log CTA button
      const logBtn = document.getElementById("log-found-cta-btn");
      if (logBtn) {
        logBtn.addEventListener("click", () => {
          window.location.href = "/";
        });
      }
    })();
  </script>
</Base>